  "cliHelp": "UnityStarter, a hub for Unity and Tuanjie.\n\nUsage:\n  unitystarter projects [--query text]           list projects\n  unitystarter editors                         list installed editors\n  unitystarter open <path|name>                open a project in its editor\n  unitystarter new <folder> [--editor version] create a project\n  unitystarter hub status                      show the hubs taken over\n  unitystarter hub sync                        add added projects to the hubs\n  unitystarter releases                        list the editors to install\n  unitystarter install <version> [--simulate]  install an editor\n  unitystarter update                          check for a newer release\n  unitystarter version                         print the version\n\nFlags:\n  --json      print JSON\n  --lang      en or zh-Hans\n  --verbose   log to the terminal\n\nWith no command, the window opens.",
